      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "2. B: Nèige? Zhèige lánde, háishi     Which one? This blue one or this\n      zhèige hóngde?                  red one?\n\nNote on No. 2\n\nHáishi means \"or.\" In a choice-type question without háishi, both choices must include a verb; but in a question containing háishi, the second verb may be omitted.\n\nNǐ  | mǎi  | zhèige  | háishi  | (mǎi)  | nèige?\n(Are you buying this one or that one?)\n"
